  "Wind Burst <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Wind damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, with a $2 base chance to inflict Windswept, then inflict the target with [Wind Erosion] for $3 turns, there can only be $4 [Wind Erosion]. When foe with [Wind Erosion] is defeated, transfer their [Wind Erosion] to the foe with the highest HP.\\nPassive: When allies use skills, if any skill target has [Wind Erosion], increase skill ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> + $7 for every $6 ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#C0C0C0>Restless winds spiral gracefully to the ground, blades of storm bursting forth from the vortex's heart—this tender fury deals Wind damage to foes.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Windchaser's Breath Lv.$1": "",
  "Windchaser's Breath <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Decrease party's DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> for $2 turns; Then increase the main target's ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> + $5 for every $4 ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color>, and DMG Bonus by $8 for every $7 ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$9</color>. Lasts for $10 turns.\\n<b><size=28><color=#C0C0C0>Countless vines erupt from the earth, entwining into an emerald curtain, pliant yet unbreakable, shielding allies from harm.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Arrow of Rejuvenation Lv.$1": "",
  "Arrow of Rejuvenation <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Restore party's HP by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Yukari's ATK + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>. Spend all [Wind Whisper], for each [Wind Whisper] stack spent, restore $4 {{B}} Energy to the main target, then increase the target's ATK after using {{B}} by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> for $6 turns. Stacks up to $7 times. (When restoring {{B}} Energy, save the overflow {{B}} Energy then return it after the target used {{B}}, up to their {{B}} Energy cap. Lasts for 2 turns). If the main target is not a S.E.E.S. member, then for every stack of [Wind Whisper] spent, increase their next HIGHLIGHT Total DMG Amp by <color=#FFFC40>$9</color>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#C0C0C0>An arrow loosed pierces the heavens, parting the sky's veil, light cascades down, flowing over allies' wounds, filling them with the wind's gentleness.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Cyclone Arrow: Use condition: When Yukari has $1 {{A}} Energy\\nDeal <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK Wind damage to 1 foe. Increase party's DMG Dealt by $4 for every $3 ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>; Remove $6 buffs on the target, with a $7 base chance to inflict Windswept, then inflict the target with [Wind Erosion] for $8 turns.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Wind damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Gun damage to 1 foe.\\nAssist Skill: Dispel 1 Status Ailment from 1 ally.": "",
  "When {{A}} is present, increase all allies' HIGHLIGHT/{{B}} DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>. After any ally uses a HIGHLIGHT/{{B}}, increase that ally's DMG Bonus by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns.": "",
  "When {{A}} is present, increase all allies' HIGHLIGHT/{{B}} DMG Dealt by <color=#0169ca>$1</color>. After any ally uses a HIGHLIGHT/{{B}}, increase that ally's DMG Bonus by <color=#0169ca>$2</color> for $3 turns.": "",
  "During battle, for every $1 ATK, increase Max HP by $2, up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> Max HP.": "",
  "During battle, for every $1 ATK, increase Max HP by $2, up to <color=#0169ca>$3</color> Max HP.": "",
  "After an ally uses a {{A}}/HIGHLIGHT, increase their Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>. Lasts for $2 turns.\\n[Arrow of Rejuvenation] additionally increase S.E.E.S allies and Wind allies' DMG Bonus by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> and ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>. Lasts for $5 turns.": "",
  "After an ally uses a {{A}}/HIGHLIGHT, increase their Crit DMG by <color=#0169ca>$1</color>. Lasts for $2 turns.\\n[Arrow of Rejuvenation] additionally increase S.E.E.S allies and Wind allies' DMG Bonus by <color=#0169ca>$3</color> and ATK by <color=#0169ca>$4</color>. Lasts for $5 turns.": "",
  "When using [Windchaser's Breath], if the main target is a S.E.E.S ally, additionally increase their {{A}} DMG Amp by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> + Yukari's Awareness level * $2. If the main target is a Wind ally, additionally increase their Total DMG Amp by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> + Yukari's Awareness level * $4. Lasts for $5 turns.": "",
  "When using [Windchaser's Breath], if the main target is a S.E.E.S ally, additionally increase their {{A}} DMG Amp by <color=#0169ca>$1</color> + Yukari's Awareness level * $2. If the main target is a Wind ally, additionally increase their Total DMG Amp by <color=#0169ca>$3</color> + Yukari's Awareness level * $4. Lasts for $5 turns.": "",
