  "r:\"^Deal Wind damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. Also, inflict <link\\=\"s\\|105\"><u>Windswept</u></link> and Erosion for (\\d+) turns\\. Multiple foes cannot be inflicted with Erosion at the same time\\. If a foe with Erosion is defeated, Erosion is transferred to the foe with the highest HP\\.\\nPassive: When an ally attacks a foe with a skill, if any target is inflicted with Erosion, increase that skill's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% for every (\\d+) points of Yukari's Attack \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Swirling cyclones descend from above, dealing Wind damage to an enemy\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Decrease party's damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nAlso, increase the main target's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% for every (\\d+) points of Yukari's Attack \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\), and increase damage by ([\\d\\.]+)% for every (\\d+) points of Yukari's Attack \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\) for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>A gentle breeze rustles through the leaves, reducing allies' damage taken\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Restore HP to all allies equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Yukari's Attack \\+ <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\.\\nSpend all Whisperwind stacks, and for each stack spent, increase the main target's Theurgy gauge by ([\\d\\.]+), and after the next time the target activates a Theurgy, increase Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. This effect stacks up to (\\d+) times\\. If the Theurgy gauge is increased above the maximum, the amount above the maximum is temporarily reserved for up to (\\d+) turns, and returned after the Theurgy is activated\\.\\nIf the main target has a Highlight, the next time they activate a Highlight, increase final damage amplification by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for every Whisperwind stack spent\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>A soothing wind blows, restoring HP to all allies\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Cyclone Arrow：Can be activated when Theurgy gauge is at (\\d+)\\. Deal Wind damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. Also, remove (\\d+) buffs from the target, and inflict <link\\=\"s\\|105\"><u>Windswept</u></link> and Erosion\\.\\nAlso, increase party's damage by ([\\d\\.]+)% for every (\\d+) points of Yukari's Attack \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\) for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Wind damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\.\\nAssist：Remove (\\d+) debuff from 1 ally\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^When Yukari is present, increase party's Highlight and Theurgy damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\. When an ally activates a Highlight or Theurgy, increase that ally's damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^During battle, increase max HP by (\\d+) for every (\\d+) points of Yukari's Attack \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "Yukari can inflict Erosion on foes.\\nWhen other allies deal skill damage to a foe inflicted with Erosion, restore HP to all allies equal to 24.5% of Yukari's Attack + 800/1600/2400 (effect changes at Lv. 1/50/70, respectively), and gain 1 Whisperwind stack (stacks up to 2 times). This effect can only activate once between the start of Yukari's turn and the start of her next turn.": "",
  "At the start of battle, gain up to the maximum number of Whisperwind stacks, and fill Theurgy gauge by 70. If the Theurgy gauge is increased above the maximum on the first turn, up to 35 above the maximum can be reserved.\\nAlso, when using a skill on an ally, increase the main target's pierce rate by 20% more for 2 turns. If using Tailwind's Breath, restore 1200 more HP to all allies, and restore 30% more HP to the main target.": "",
