  "r:\"^Restore HP to all allies \\(([\\d\\.]+)% of Yukari's Atk \\+ ([\\d]+)\\)\\.\\nSpend all Whisperwind, and increase main target's Theurgy gauge ([\\d\\.]+) per stack, and after next time target activates Theurgy, increase Atk ([\\d\\.]+)% \\((\\d+) turns, max (\\d+) stacks\\)\\. If Theurgy gauge is increased above max, extra amount is temporarily reserved, and returned after Theurgy is activated \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nIf main target has a Highlight, the next time they activate a Highlight, increase final dmg amplification ([\\d\\.]+)% per Whisperwind spent\\.$\"": "",
